<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδιαιρ-έω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ελῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					2p.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>:— <i>divide, distribute</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκάστῳ ἄρτους ἑξήκοντα</span>
			l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.73.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					726.33
				</span></i>
			 (Milet., <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολίτας ταῖς φράτραις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς στρατ ιώτας εἰς τὴν σατ ραπείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					19.44
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοῖς . . τοὺς ἱππέας
				ἐπιδιῄρει</span>
			<i>divided and sent against</i>them,<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hisp.</u>
				25
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, of several, <i>distribute among themselves</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.150
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.116
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>make a
				crossincision</i>
			<i>in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					12.522
				</span></i>
			.</div>
